#: model:era.content.block,content_html:era_seo_suite.demo_content_block_seo_faq
msgid "<div>\n        <h3>What does an ERA SEO engagement include?</h3>\n        <p>A technical audit, on-page optimization in Arabic and English,\n           JSON-LD structured data, and monthly reporting against your target\n           keywords.</p>\n        <h3>How long until we see results?</h3>\n        <p>Technical fixes are reflected within days; ranking improvements for\n           competitive Arabic and English keywords typically build over three\n           to six months.</p>\n      </div>\n    "
